Subject: [PATCH 9/9] docs: document SBI call allowlists and the domain commit
 extension

Describe the ecall-allowlist and config-digest device tree properties,
the filtering of SBI calls, the experimental domain commit extension,
the per-hart commit records and their report, and the allocation of the
domain switch contexts at boot.

